### Fitment API Tests

### Send Fitment Data to Shopify - Valid Variant ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Fitment/SendFitmentData/12345
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Send Fitment Data to Shopify - Invalid Variant ID (0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Fitment/SendFitmentData/0
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Send Fitment Data to Shopify - Negative Variant ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Fitment/SendFitmentData/-1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Send Fitment Data to Shopify - Non-existent Variant ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Fitment/SendFitmentData/999999
Content-Type: application/json

###

# Variables for testing
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
